					<h2><a href="index.html?p=295" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link to Ahmaddin-as-Salik Abdallah">Ahmaddin-as-Salik Abdallah</a></h2>
					<!-- p class="post-info">Jan 16th, 2009 by <a href="http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?author=3" title="Posts by khushi" rel="author">khushi</a> </p -->
					<p class="post-meta"><ul class='post-meta'>
</ul>
</p>
